// # oohat package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oohat (layers/L7-agents).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oohat.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oohat.oo.
